+// favProbeJS 读收藏条数 + 「还有没有更多」+ 当前子 tab。全部防御式：任何一项读不到都给「不知道」，不抛错。
+const favProbeJS = `() => {
+		const unwrap = x => x?.value ?? x?._value ?? x?._rawValue ?? x;
+		const out = {count: 0, hasMore: -1, tab: "", queryKeys: ""};
+		try {
+			const u = window.__INITIAL_STATE__?.user;
+			const notes = unwrap(u?.notes);
+			const active = unwrap(u?.activeTab) || {};
+			const idx = active.index;
+			if (typeof active.query === "string") out.tab = active.query;
+			const list = (notes && idx !== undefined && idx !== null) ? unwrap(notes[idx]) : null;
+			out.count = (list && typeof list.length === "number") ? list.length : 0;
+			const qs = unwrap(u?.noteQueries);
+			const q = (qs && idx !== undefined && idx !== null) ? unwrap(qs[idx]) : null;
+			if (q && typeof q === "object") {
+				out.queryKeys = Object.keys(q).slice(0, 8).join(",");
+				if (typeof q.hasMore === "boolean") out.hasMore = q.hasMore ? 1 : 0;
+			}
+		} catch (e) {}
+		return out;
+	}`
